// The maintainer's ECJ reference of 2026-09-28, as two slides so the carousel has a last
// grid: the call to comment is drawn on the second grid and on no story.
//
// Inside a `::lamina`, a line with one `|` starts a day — the day, then its schedule — and
// every line with none under it is one of that day's mock exams. The counts differ on
// purpose: two days of two and one exams, then one of one.
//
// One slide feeds both formats, so it has to fit the grid, the shorter of the two: three
// exams in two days is about what a grid holds. A slide that does not fit runs off the
// bottom of the grid, and the render says so with W_TEMPLATE_OVERFLOW (TYTO-202).

